basis and implications for breast cancer</article-title><source>Expert Rev Mol Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>15</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17178008</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1017/S1462399406000196</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>